            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " is a lawful evil diabolic demigod, the infernal duke of beasts, hunters, and tradition. Known also as the Pack Lord, he appears as a fire-breathing, lion-headed, heavily armored archer with eagle talons for feet. His symbol is a dragon-legged horse, said to be a representation of his favored mount.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Edicts",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " hunt those who are capable of thinking for themselves, gather like-minded hunters into groups based in hunting lodges, burn places of worship devoted to Erastil or corrupt those who follow his faith",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Anathema",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "content": " sleep in a place sacred to Erastil, willingly harm a lion, grant a merciful death to a creature you have wounded",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
